And if you think it's ridiculous that Homelander, the influencer superhero, could be leader of the free world,

00:14:47.100 --> 00:14:50.500
remember, someone who was also an influencer and CEO,

00:14:50.500 --> 00:14:54.500
who used that to run a campaign that earned billions of dollars in free advertising,

